## VERIFICATION CHECKLIST

[chk-00003] helpful=0 harmful=0 :: Before writing code, map all mandatory sampling criteria (e.g., specific entity/country combinations) into a boolean mask column. Use `df.loc[mask, 'Flag'] = 1` to ensure all required rows are captured and verified before calculating final sample counts.
