## PROBLEM-SOLVING HEURISTICS

[ph-00004] helpful=0 harmful=0 :: Decompose complex requirements into a checklist of data-transformation steps. When a task requires multiple output artifacts (e.g., multiple Excel tabs), define the structure of each tab as a distinct data object in your code before attempting to write them to the final file to prevent omissions due to truncation.
